<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Remove a channel mute from a user, allowing them to send messages again."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it when a mute has done its job early, or when you muted the wrong person. A timed mute ends by itself. A permanent mute stays until someone removes it with this command."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unmute <nickname>")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>nickname</code> {dgettext("help_commands", "— The user to unmute.")}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The command acts on the channel you are viewing. It lifts every active mute for that nickname in this channel. A timed mute also stops its countdown. You see a confirmation line, and the user can talk in the channel again at once."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The user does not need to be in the channel, so you can lift a mute after they leave. If the user was not muted, the command still reports success and nothing changes."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Requires channel operator or owner status")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Half-operators cannot use this command")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "You must type it in a channel window, not in a private conversation"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Only the first nickname is used. Extra words are ignored.")}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unmute Alice")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-mute">{dgettext("help_commands", "/mute")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="ui-context-menu">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Context Menu")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-kick">{dgettext("help_commands", "/kick")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="channel-permissions">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Channel Permissions")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
